## Role Hierarchy Configuration

{%- set valid_orders = ['<domain>_<env>_<dataproduct>', '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>', '<env>_<domain>_<dataproduct>'] %}
{%- set order = object_component_order if object_component_order is defined and object_component_order in valid_orders else '<domain>_<dataproduct>_<env>' %}
{%- set strategy = account_strategy if account_strategy is defined else 'Single Account' %}
{%- set parts = [] %}
{%- for component in order.split('_') %}
{%- set token = component[1:-1] %}
{%- if token == 'domain' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Domain-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_domain | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'env' and strategy not in ['Multi-Account (Environment-based)', 'Multi-Account (Domain + Environment)'] %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_environment | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- elif token == 'dataproduct' %}{%- if parts.append(data_product_name | upper) %}{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- set prefix = parts | join('_') %}
{%- set scim_enabled = scim_prefix and (scim_prefix | trim) and (scim_prefix | trim | upper) != 'NONE' %}

### Core Role Hierarchy

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      ADMIN                                   │
│         {{ prefix }}_ADMIN                                   │
│           ┌─────────┼─────────┐                              │
│           ▼         ▼         ▼                              │
│       CREATE      RBAC    Account Access                     │
│           │         │      Roles (5)                         │
│           ▼         │                                        │
│        WRITE ◄──────┤                                        │
│           │         │                                        │
│           ▼         ▼                                        │
│         READ ◄──────┘                                        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Database Role Connections

| Database | DB_R → | DB_W → | DB_C → |
|----------|--------|--------|--------|
{%- for config in schema_configuration %}
{%- set zone = config.zone | upper %}
{%- set db_name = prefix ~ '_' ~ zone %}
| `{{ db_name }}` | `{{ prefix }}_READ` | `{{ prefix }}_WRITE` | `{{ prefix }}_CREATE` |
{%- endfor %}

### Account Access Roles

| Role | Privilege | Granted To |
|------|-----------|------------|
| `{{ prefix }}_AR_EXEC_TASK` | EXECUTE TASK | `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` |
| `{{ prefix }}_AR_VIEW_AUSG` | View SNOWFLAKE DB | `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` |
| `{{ prefix }}_AR_APPLY_DDM` | APPLY MASKING POLICY | `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` |
| `{{ prefix }}_AR_APPLY_RAP` | APPLY ROW ACCESS POLICY | `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` |
| `{{ prefix }}_AR_APPLY_TAG` | APPLY TAG | `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` |

### SCIM Integration

{%- if scim_enabled %}
| Connection | Target |
|------------|--------|
| `{{ prefix }}_ADMIN` | → `{{ scim_prefix | trim | upper }}_PROVISIONER` |

Users can be assigned to data product roles through your identity provider.
